Dialogue: 9,0:00:15.54,0:00:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, that's my third kill.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:17.68,0:00:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a sonar ping!
Dialogue: 9,0:00:18.76,0:00:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure thing.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:22.70,0:00:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are!
Dialogue: 9,0:00:26.47,0:00:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Idiot, those were civilians!
Dialogue: 9,0:00:32.35,0:00:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop doing that.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:34.17,0:00:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,How many is that now?
Dialogue: 9,0:00:35.99,0:00:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,They shouldn't just stand around here.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:40.65,0:00:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't get away!
Dialogue: 9,0:00:42.91,0:00:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,791)}Stop running.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:47.21,0:00:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd he go?
Dialogue: 9,0:00:52.46,0:00:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe another sonar ping?
Dialogue: 9,0:00:54.79,0:00:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No, he's probably already hiding.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:59.45,0:01:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 9,0:01:04.18,0:01:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys suck.
Dialogue: 9,0:01:07.40,0:01:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch this.
Dialogue: 9,0:01:32.54,0:01:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 9,0:01:33.87,0:01:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He made it look easy!
Dialogue: 9,0:01:36.95,0:01:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Just die, dumbass.
Dialogue: 9,0:01:50.07,0:01:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously, I'm unbeatable.
