Dialogue: 9,0:03:25.38,0:03:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Woohoo! Are you serious?!
Dialogue: 9,0:03:27.75,0:03:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That's twenty straight wins!
Dialogue: 9,0:03:29.35,0:03:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,No sweat, right, Sakamoto?
Dialogue: 9,0:03:31.88,0:03:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give me that.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:33.34,0:03:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I{\i0} did most of the work.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:36.91,0:03:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow. You've got four stars now.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:39.90,0:03:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We're #10 in the whole world!
Dialogue: 9,0:03:43.20,0:03:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,No BTOOOM! player in Japan is any match for us.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:47.37,0:03:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll have to start playing stronger opponents outside Japan or my rank won't increase.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:51.56,0:03:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,New Challenger!
Dialogue: 9,0:03:54.00,0:03:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like someone must've heard you.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:57.28,0:03:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It says they're rank #2 worldwide!
Dialogue: 9,0:03:59.87,0:04:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 9,0:04:01.36,0:04:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Accept, what else?
Dialogue: 9,0:04:03.51,0:04:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let's do this! Let's reach #1!
Dialogue: 9,0:04:09.48,0:04:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,BTOOOM!
Dialogue: 9,0:04:10.80,0:04:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,This game's sold over three million copies worldwide.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:14.39,0:04:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And it doesn't use guns...
Dialogue: 9,0:04:16.72,0:04:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,only bombs.
