Dialogue: 9,0:04:24.74,0:04:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}and use sonar to find enemies while remaining out of their sight.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:30.03,0:04:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how you win this game.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:33.75,0:04:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,BTOOOM!
Dialogue: 9,0:04:35.00,0:04:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, Sakamoto...
Dialogue: 9,0:04:36.87,0:04:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,we're keeping up with #2!
Dialogue: 9,0:04:39.75,0:04:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:41.39,0:04:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to become #1 in the world.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:47.20,0:04:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm twenty-two, and I still don't have a job.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:49.50,0:04:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I sit around all day, doing nothing.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:53.52,0:04:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But... in the world of BTOOOM!,
Dialogue: 9,0:04:58.27,0:04:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm stronger than anyone,
Dialogue: 9,0:04:59.90,0:05:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,more respected than anyone,
Dialogue: 9,0:05:01.74,0:05:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,and greater than anyone.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:06.00,0:05:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I even got married.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:08.50,0:05:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Only within the game's virtual world, of course.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:12.92,0:05:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,860)}I was content.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:15.29,0:05:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, in this wonderful place.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:19.17,0:05:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I never realized I was just escaping there.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:26.84,0:05:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Where am I?
Dialogue: 9,0:05:36.67,0:05:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}My whole body hurts.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:38.45,0:05:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why?
Dialogue: 9,0:05:42.18,0:05:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,A parachute?!
Dialogue: 9,0:05:43.46,0:05:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 9,0:05:45.77,0:05:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Crap, I can't get down.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:48.65,0:05:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone there?
Dialogue: 9,0:05:49.93,0:05:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Is anyone around?
Dialogue: 9,0:06:01.00,0:06:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What {\i1}is{\i0} this?
Dialogue: 9,0:06:05.72,0:06:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:10.44,0:06:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What is this place?
Dialogue: 9,0:06:13.19,0:06:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I've got no idea.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:14.81,0:06:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What am I doing here?
Dialogue: 9,0:06:17.98,0:06:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why can't I remember anything?
Dialogue: 9,0:06:21.56,0:06:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I think... I was playing BTOOOM! in my room.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:24.86,0:06:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And then...
Dialogue: 9,0:06:31.65,0:06:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Blood?
Dialogue: 9,0:06:33.78,0:06:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What the hell's happened that I can't remember?!
Dialogue: 9,0:06:42.96,0:06:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,My phone...
