Dialogue: 9,0:06:48.19,0:06:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:52.30,0:06:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Wha—
Dialogue: 9,0:06:53.55,0:06:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 9,0:06:55.17,0:06:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,G-Glass?
Dialogue: 9,0:06:57.68,0:06:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it embedded in my skin?
Dialogue: 9,0:07:01.43,0:07:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can feel it, but it doesn't hurt or feel wrong.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:05.35,0:07:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I haven't been kidnapped by \Na UFO or anything, have I?
Dialogue: 9,0:07:22.59,0:07:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,My bag!
Dialogue: 9,0:07:25.41,0:07:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,My wallet's here.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:26.84,0:07:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And a change of clothes.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:28.30,0:07:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So was I going somewhere overnight?
Dialogue: 9,0:07:31.06,0:07:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 9,0:07:36.02,0:07:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,A convenience store bag.
