Dialogue: 9,0:07:50.48,0:07:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,For now, I guess I should find out where I am.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:00.54,0:08:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, it's hot!
Dialogue: 9,0:08:03.84,0:08:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Seems like I'm pretty far south.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:09.63,0:08:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'd better save this.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:17.47,0:08:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a huge-ass bug.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:21.42,0:08:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this an actual tropical forest?
Dialogue: 9,0:08:27.07,0:08:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm dead meat!
Dialogue: 9,0:08:40.60,0:08:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Give me a break.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:42.83,0:08:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What did I do?
Dialogue: 9,0:08:45.38,0:08:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What...
Dialogue: 9,0:08:52.74,0:08:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Ow.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:02.83,0:09:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 9,0:09:04.39,0:09:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the hell am I?!
Dialogue: 9,0:09:11.21,0:09:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 9,0:09:13.65,0:09:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You wrote me a resume and sent it to the grocery store, didn't you?
Dialogue: 9,0:09:18.15,0:09:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't work there.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:23.80,0:09:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I already have a job I want!
Dialogue: 9,0:09:26.01,0:09:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay out of my business!
Dialogue: 9,0:09:36.57,0:09:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll go to Satoru's.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:38.87,0:09:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You, there.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:40.97,0:09:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You're Sakamoto Ryouta{-san}, aren't you?
Dialogue: 9,0:09:52.04,0:09:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's starting to come back to me.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:55.74,0:09:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Someone stopped me as I was leaving the store.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:01.39,0:10:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Forcing myself to remember \Njust makes my head hurt.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:13.16,0:10:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Good thing I bought a lunch.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:16.64,0:10:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But... what about tomorrow?
Dialogue: 9,0:10:21.17,0:10:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't recognize that pouch.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:24.20,0:10:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It probably isn't mine.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:28.06,0:10:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Did someone put it in my bag?
Dialogue: 9,0:10:32.56,0:10:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this thing?
Dialogue: 9,0:10:38.36,0:10:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oops, I pressed something.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:44.60,0:10:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have a bad feeling.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:52.44,0:10:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No way—
Dialogue: 9,0:11:01.75,0:11:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 9,0:11:03.57,0:11:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 9,0:11:08.71,0:11:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}These are all bombs?
Dialogue: 9,0:11:12.04,0:11:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What were they doing in my bag?
Dialogue: 9,0:11:19.71,0:11:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,They're... They're nothing to do with me!
Dialogue: 9,0:11:27.87,0:11:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There's someone there.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:30.66,0:11:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 9,0:11:33.32,0:11:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you help me?
Dialogue: 9,0:11:44.80,0:11:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What?
Dialogue: 9,0:11:53.94,0:11:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with him?
Dialogue: 9,0:11:57.02,0:11:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is just like...
Dialogue: 9,0:11:59.40,0:12:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}the game!
Dialogue: 9,0:12:01.54,0:12:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No way.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:03.57,0:12:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No way!
Dialogue: 9,0:12:06.88,0:12:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm supposed to play BTOOOM! for real now?
Dialogue: 9,0:12:13.55,0:12:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm supposed to play BTOOOM! for real?
Dialogue: 9,0:12:15.97,0:12:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You've gotta be kidding!
Dialogue: 9,0:12:17.69,0:12:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't do that!
Dialogue: 9,0:12:24.52,0:12:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's seriously trying to kill me.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:26.87,0:12:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit running around, you coward!
Dialogue: 9,0:12:28.93,0:12:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You piece of crap!
Dialogue: 9,0:12:40.51,0:12:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I lose him?
Dialogue: 9,0:12:42.65,0:12:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,The most important part of BTOOOM! is hiding from the enemy.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:45.93,0:12:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Running is how you win—
Dialogue: 9,0:12:51.28,0:12:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's here?
Dialogue: 9,0:12:52.40,0:12:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}How did he find me?
Dialogue: 9,0:12:54.38,0:12:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Do I have to fight him?
Dialogue: 9,0:12:56.75,0:12:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But if one of these hits him...
Dialogue: 9,0:12:59.77,0:13:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll kill him for sure!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:03.60,0:13:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That's hot!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:05.46,0:13:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't have a choice!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:07.70,0:13:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Why isn't he fighting back?
Dialogue: 9,0:13:10.28,0:13:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he still spouting that purist crap?
Dialogue: 9,0:13:20.07,0:13:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the deal?! It didn't explode?
Dialogue: 9,0:13:22.62,0:13:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The last one sure did!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:28.10,0:13:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh right, the switch...
Dialogue: 9,0:13:30.62,0:13:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:32.20,0:13:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That was close.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:34.17,0:13:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got a good arm.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:36.49,0:13:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd better get farther back.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:42.63,0:13:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Another dud?
Dialogue: 9,0:13:44.72,0:13:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You've gotta be kidding me!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:47.83,0:13:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would it explode just now?
Dialogue: 9,0:13:50.65,0:13:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That moron doesn't even know how to use his bombs?
Dialogue: 9,0:13:56.40,0:13:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,How do I use these?
Dialogue: 9,0:13:57.82,0:13:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't there a manual somewhere?
Dialogue: 9,0:14:06.36,0:14:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, where did he go?
Dialogue: 9,0:14:09.95,0:14:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:12.34,0:14:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer me.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:14.58,0:14:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you attacking me?
Dialogue: 9,0:14:17.31,0:14:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are we?
Dialogue: 9,0:14:20.19,0:14:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,And these bombs,
Dialogue: 9,0:14:21.93,0:14:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,this glass crystal on my hand...
Dialogue: 9,0:14:24.40,0:14:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you ever heard of the\N online game BTOOOM!?
Dialogue: 9,0:14:32.60,0:14:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, you're a dumbass!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:34.48,0:14:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't remember anything?
Dialogue: 9,0:14:36.84,0:14:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't even know how to use a bomb, but you think you've cornered me?
Dialogue: 9,0:14:42.15,0:14:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make me laugh.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:44.43,0:14:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't tell you a thing before you die!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:47.40,0:14:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:56.83,0:14:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I missed again?
Dialogue: 9,0:14:58.95,0:15:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why is this happening to me?
Dialogue: 9,0:15:02.39,0:15:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What did I do?
Dialogue: 9,0:15:06.46,0:15:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's just a normal Japanese guy, right?
Dialogue: 9,0:15:08.84,0:15:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I spoke to him.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:10.80,0:15:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would he kill... {CR had: There's no reason for him to kill me.\i1}
Dialogue: 9,0:15:14.43,0:15:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I give up.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:15.40,0:15:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I surrender!
Dialogue: 9,0:15:16.53,0:15:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't kill me.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:21.97,0:15:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That was so stupid.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:28.24,0:15:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Am I... going to die here?
Dialogue: 9,0:15:35.05,0:15:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you go?!
Dialogue: 9,0:15:37.28,0:15:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you aren't dead yet.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:39.83,0:15:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Come out, wuss!
Dialogue: 9,0:15:43.65,0:15:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No, I don't want to die.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:47.61,0:15:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wh-What's this?
Dialogue: 9,0:15:49.72,0:15:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can feel it.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:51.25,0:15:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can tell he's near me.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:54.40,0:15:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Could this be...
Dialogue: 9,0:15:57.61,0:16:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}just like the BTOOOM! radar?
Dialogue: 9,0:16:01.96,0:16:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Then hiding won't...
Dialogue: 9,0:16:12.00,0:16:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Another miss?
Dialogue: 9,0:16:14.14,0:16:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm sure he's holed up nearby.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:17.33,0:16:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,No doubt about it.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:19.76,0:16:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If he has radar, then hiding is pointless.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:22.70,0:16:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But why won't my bombs...
Dialogue: 9,0:16:26.87,0:16:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Back then, there was a number!
Dialogue: 9,0:16:29.89,0:16:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's on a timer?!
Dialogue: 9,0:16:31.57,0:16:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Damn it!
Dialogue: 9,0:16:32.78,0:16:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't I notice earlier?{Because you're an idiot, obviously. -GBF\i1}
Dialogue: 9,0:16:35.29,0:16:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}In BTOOOM!, his bombs are called "Crackers."
Dialogue: 9,0:16:39.06,0:16:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They explode upon impact.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:42.99,0:16:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mine use timers.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:44.80,0:16:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You press the switch, and it explodes when the timer reaches zero.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:51.25,0:16:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So, it's just like BTOOOM!?
Dialogue: 9,0:16:56.35,0:16:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Calm down.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:57.41,0:16:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Relax.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:59.08,0:17:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm the ace of the team that's #10 in the world.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:02.71,0:17:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can use bombs with timers!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:09.68,0:17:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't move.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:14.48,0:17:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't see him.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:19.74,0:17:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Damn it!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:20.95,0:17:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If this were the game... If this were the game...
Dialogue: 9,0:17:25.06,0:17:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Then this is for real, huh?
Dialogue: 9,0:17:27.72,0:17:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Tenth in the world?
Dialogue: 9,0:17:30.49,0:17:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's all just virtual glory.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:35.53,0:17:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, coward!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:39.31,0:17:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're hiding in that crack between the rocks!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:44.61,0:17:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He doesn't know where I am?
Dialogue: 9,0:17:45.85,0:17:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is my chance.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:47.47,0:17:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:48.87,0:17:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If he's in those bushes,
Dialogue: 9,0:17:51.90,0:17:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,couldn't he blow me up from behind?
Dialogue: 9,0:17:54.05,0:17:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't figure it out, damn it!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:56.49,0:18:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it won't matter anyway...
Dialogue: 9,0:18:03.63,0:18:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,if I throw bombs both ways.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:06.55,0:18:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I...
Dialogue: 9,0:18:08.26,0:18:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell, coward.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:11.54,0:18:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...have no choice.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:21.67,0:18:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Idiot!
Dialogue: 9,0:18:22.95,0:18:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you stay underwater forever?
Dialogue: 9,0:18:25.12,0:18:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,When you surface for air, I'll nail you!
Dialogue: 9,0:18:30.72,0:18:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}7... 6... 5...
Dialogue: 9,0:18:33.63,0:18:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}4... 3...
Dialogue: 9,0:19:07.71,0:19:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I had no choice.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:11.13,0:19:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He would've killed me.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:14.05,0:19:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It was self-defense.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:16.54,0:19:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't do anything wrong.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:19.28,0:19:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not my fault.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:20.94,0:19:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not...
Dialogue: 9,0:19:24.96,0:19:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}His bombs.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:30.06,0:19:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So, I'm supposed to take them to survive?
Dialogue: 9,0:19:34.71,0:19:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Just like the game, it's all about killing.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:37.81,0:19:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And...
Dialogue: 9,0:19:39.32,0:19:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have to play it in real life?
