Dialogue: 9,0:21:18.23,0:21:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me,
Dialogue: 9,0:21:19.52,0:21:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Iida
Dialogue: 9,0:21:21.67,0:21:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,about what we discussed earlier.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:24.57,0:21:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,About hiring me...
Dialogue: 9,0:21:28.34,0:21:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:30.68,0:21:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you wait just a little longer?
Dialogue: 9,0:21:34.61,0:21:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The company's so busy right now.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:38.38,0:21:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Ryouta?
Dialogue: 9,0:21:40.82,0:21:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You're playing that game again.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:43.66,0:21:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey,
Dialogue: 9,0:21:44.47,0:21:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,don't open my door without knocking!
Dialogue: 9,0:21:46.11,0:21:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I did knock, but you had those things on.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:50.95,0:21:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it, Sakamoto?
Dialogue: 9,0:21:52.78,0:21:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You're fighting with your mom again?
Dialogue: 9,0:21:54.56,0:21:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, that's lame.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:56.02,0:21:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It spoils all the fun.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:58.97,0:22:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm online now. Leave me alone.
Dialogue: 9,0:22:01.18,0:22:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to talk.
Dialogue: 9,0:22:02.79,0:22:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about a job for you.
Dialogue: 9,0:22:06.24,0:22:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I spoke with a relative of mine, Uncle Kazu, to see if they could do anything for you.
Dialogue: 9,0:22:12.45,0:22:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You remember Uncle Kazu, right?
Dialogue: 9,0:22:15.64,0:22:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He currently runs an udon restaurant.
Dialogue: 9,0:22:18.02,0:22:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave me alone.
Dialogue: 9,0:22:20.27,0:22:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I already have a job I want.
Dialogue: 9,0:22:23.80,0:22:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been saying that for two years, and you're still unemployed.
Dialogue: 9,0:22:28.10,0:22:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}It's time to stop dreaming about working for a video game company.
Dialogue: 9,0:22:32.73,0:22:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Go out, and find a real job!
Dialogue: 9,0:22:36.86,0:22:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't I do that later?
Dialogue: 9,0:22:40.31,0:22:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking about your future here!
Dialogue: 9,0:22:43.34,0:22:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Just get out!
Dialogue: 9,0:22:59.31,0:22:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A dream?
Dialogue: 9,0:23:03.88,0:23:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, right.
Dialogue: 9,0:23:05.36,0:23:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is the real world.
Dialogue: 9,0:23:08.66,0:23:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 9,0:23:11.15,0:23:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3\i1}Come to think of it, I barfed up everything I ate yesterday.
Dialogue: 9,0:24:07.75,0:24:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a reason I ended up on this island.
Dialogue: 9,0:24:11.47,0:24:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a reason I can't go back.
Dialogue: 9,0:24:14.01,0:24:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my punishment.
Dialogue: 9,0:24:17.06,0:24:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The punishment for my betrayal.
